{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":15,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"3735aaad-54b5-4676-b414-fe2cf7fa0fc6","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351445103,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"项目经理（安服）(J14178)","OrgId":748547,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"安全服务项目管理","Require":"具备安服项目管理经验","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-04-17T10:25:41","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"710f547f-9796-4f50-a88e-ca7c3244f1e0","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351093340,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"能源三部总经理","OrgId":946310,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"工作职责:\n1、面向石油行业客户（三桶油）制定销售策略并执行；\n2、负责团队的销售管理工作，带领团队成员完成公司下达的销售任务；\n3、挖掘并逐步引导行业需求，树立公司产品在该行业的品牌和产品优势地位；\n4、负责公司产品的销售及推广，开拓新市场，发展新客户，增加产品销售范围；\n5、维系所辖行业的客户关系，建立长期稳固的行业客户关系；\n6、负责机会项目的商务谈判或投标，完成销售合同及合同收款。","Require":"任职资格:\n1、大专及以上学历；\n2、五年以上直接客户销售经验，长期从事三桶油客户销售者优先；\n3、了解和熟悉该行业的业务情况及IT总体规划；\n4、语言表达和思维逻辑清晰、具备良好的沟通协调能力以及分析问题的能力；\n5、有IT行业销售经验且具有管理团队经验者优先考虑。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2023-09-27T16:41:32","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"4c526a64-97b1-41c1-9773-58449cd61011","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":350881438,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级运维开发工程师","OrgId":748538,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 负责自动化测试平台的日常环境运维、环境建设工作；\n2. 负责通过自动化平台监控维护测试任务运行，并处理解决运行异常；\n3. 负责运维规范、流程文档编制，总结工作中遇到的问题，探索、完善运维方法、流程、文档并将其工具化、平台化，确保运维安全，提升运维效率和效果，有效降低故障发生率；\n4. 关注研发全流程的效率提升与经验落地，支撑日常开发、测试和运维工作。主动发现研发与测试环境的问题和隐患，通过开发或推进自动化运维工具来降低手工操作的维护成本； \n5. 负责设计DevOps平台实现配置管理、持续集成、持续交付、持续测试、业务监控等功能，并形成相关规范；\n6. 负责突发事件管理，问题跟踪与管理；能够运用监控，日志分析等工具进行复杂问题定位。","Require":"1. 统招本科及以上学历，5年以上相关工作经验；\n2. 精通二三层网络知识，能够排查机房测试网络问题；\n3. 掌握Linux系统(Centos)系统管理维护工作，熟练使用Linux操作系统基础命令，熟悉各类应用服务搭建、配置、监控和维护；\n4. 掌握Python及Shell，能编写常用自动化运维工具；\n5. 掌握devops相关知识，具备设计以及落地devops平台能力；\n5. 熟悉虚拟化及部署运维方式，熟悉kvm、OpenStack、docker等虚拟化和容器技术，热衷新技术，动手能力强，有钻研精神； \n6. 有丰富的系统故障排查和解决经验，突出的分析和解决问题的能力；\n7. 有良好的沟通协作能力、学习能力、团队精神；\n8. 有责任感，对于工作积极严谨。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2023-02-09T16:32:32","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"14f1cd82-32e3-4493-a04d-b4c51df517ad","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":350792401,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"辽宁政企事业部总经理","OrgId":946310,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"工作职责: \n1、面向辽宁省政法、政企客户制定销售策略并执行； 2、负责销售团队的管理工作，带领团队成员完成公司下达的销售任务； 3、挖掘并逐步引导行业需求，树立公司产品在该行业的品牌和产品优势地位； 4、负责公司产品的销售及推广，开拓新市场，发展新客户，增加产品销售范围； 5、维系所辖行业的客户关系，建立长期稳固的行业客户关系； 6、负责机会项目的商务谈判或投标，完成销售合同及合同收款。 \n","Require":"任职要求: \n1、大专及以上学历，信息安全或计算机相关专业优先； 2、三年以上直接客户销售管理经验； 3、了解和熟悉该行业的业务情况及IT总体规划； 4、语言表达和思维逻辑清晰、具备良好的沟通协调能力以及分析问题的能力； 5